## Hover

Every interactive element responds immediately and precisely. Hover on at 150ms to 200ms, hover off slightly slower at 200ms to 300ms.

**Nav links:** an underline draws from the left via `scaleX`, opacity drops to 0.7.

**CTA links:** the arrow slides right on hover, the text stays still.

```css
.cta-link { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
.cta-link svg { transition: transform 200ms var(--ease-out-soft); }
.cta-link:hover svg { transform: translateX(4px); }
```

**Images:** scale to 1.04 inside an `overflow: hidden` wrapper. No brightness change, no overlay, no shadow. Scale only.

**Buttons:** ghost fills solid and inverts text, solid darkens 10 percent via `color-mix`. No scale, no shadow.

**Cards (if used):** border opacity rises from 10 to 25 percent, and a 1px top rule wipes in from the left via `scaleX`, never `width`.

